<title>USA: Hertz Corp IPO slated for end of wk- underwriter.</title>
<headline>Hertz Corp IPO slated for end of wk- underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hertz Corp's long-awaited initial public offering is tentatively set to price this Thursday for trading on Friday, according to lead underwriter JP Morgan.</p>
<p>The car rental giant, a unit of Ford Motor Co, is offering 17.4 million shares at a price of $21 to $24 a share. Of the total number, 15.66 million shares are to be offered in the United States and Canada, according to the company's filing.</p>
<p>The company's shares are due to be traded on the big board under the stock symbol &quot;HRZ&quot;.</p>
<p>---New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
